+		/// <summary>
+		/// Re-reads the same map (same theater and dimensions) into this already-loaded
+		/// Map, keeping the VFS, rules/art, theater, lighting and per-level palettes.
+		/// Used by the editor's interactive renderer: our edits only change overlays,
+		/// structures, terrain objects and waypoints -- IsoMapPack5 and the map's rule
